{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2023-02-09 23:35:00', 'title': 'IBM SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT PENDING: CONTACT LEVI & KORSINSKY BEFORE MARCH 14, 2023 TO DISCUSS YOUR RIGHTS - IBM', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - FEBRUARY 9, 2023) - LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS MACHINES CORPORATION ("IBM" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: IBM) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT.THE LAWSUIT ON BEHALF OF IBM INVESTORS HAS BEEN COMMENCED IN THE THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE SOUTHERN DISTRICT OF NEW YORK.'}{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2023-02-09 05:45:00', 'title': 'IBM LAWSUIT ALERT: LEVI & KORSINSKY NOTIFIES INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS MACHINES CORPORATION INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND UPCOMING DEADLINE', 'text': 'NEW YORK , FEB. 9, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS MACHINES CORPORATION ("IBM" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: IBM) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT. CLASS DEFINITION: THE LAWSUIT SEEKS TO RECOVER LOSSES ON BEHALF OF IBM INVESTORS WHO WERE ADVERSELY AFFECTED BY ALLEGED SECURITIES FRAUD BETWEEN JANUARY 18, 2018 AND OCTOBER 16, 2018.'}